<title>HUNGARY: TVK 9-month operating profit 6.97 bln forints.</title>
<headline>TVK 9-month operating profit 6.97 bln forints.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine-month period ending Sept 30, 1996, compared with 12-month period Jan-Dec 1995.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Sept 96     Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Group operating profit	6,974    vs   16,236</p>
<p>Group profit before interest,</p>
<p>     extraordinaries and tax    7,438    vs   14,284</p>
<p>Group profit before tax and</p>
<p>     extraordinaries		8,278    vs   15,517</p>
<p>Group profit before</p>
<p>     extraordinaries		7,018    vs   13,032</p>
<p>    Group sales revenue	  45,705    vs   60,667</p>
<p>    Group costs of sales	 31,906    vs   36,375</p>
<p>    Gross profit		   13,799    vs   24,292</p>
<p>General, administrative</p>
<p>     expenses			 6,825    vs    8,056</p>
<p>    Other revenue		   3,121    vs    3,577</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    2,657    vs    5,529</p>
<p>    Interest revenue		1,233    vs    2,199</p>
<p>    Interest expenditure	    393    vs	966</p>
<p>    Taxation			  1,260    vs    2,485</p>
<p>NOTE - Tiszai Vegyi Kombinat Rt is a chemical company. The figures are consolidated, unaudited and calculated according to International Accounting Standards.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
